  "description": "A from-scratch, dependency-light PDF toolkit for .NET 8 / 9 / 10. Read, write, transform, secure, sign, OCR, redact, watermark, merge, split, fill forms, validate (PDF/A and PDF/UA), and convert HTML/Markdown/SVG to PDF. Includes 25+ barcode formats (Code128, QR, DataMatrix, PDF417, Aztec, GS1, EAN/UPC, Postnet, Intelligent Mail).",
